project_description:
This module enables the export of data from the "Metatag" ecosystem modules:


 Metatags 
 Schema.org Metatag 
 External Hreflang 

 Usage 
 Here is an example of how to obtain data in GraphQL queries



{

 nodeQuery {

 entities {

 ... on Node {

 metasSchema: entitySchemaMetatags

 metas: entityMetatags {

 type: __typename

 property: key

 content: value

 }

 }

 }

 }

}
